{
  "phase": "gold",
  "business_intent": "",
  "objectives": [
    "Compute total revenue per product and per store, aggregated by month and customer segment.",
    "Derive average unit price and average quantity sold per transaction to identify pricing and volume trends.",
    "Generate a KPI table that includes gross margin per product category and store, calculated as (total_amount - standard_price * quantity).",
    "Create a time\u2011based dimension (year, quarter, month) to enable cohort analysis and seasonality studies.",
    "Establish a star schema with fact_sales as the central table and dimension tables for product, store, customer_segment, and payment_method.",
    "Provide a consolidated view of top\u2011performing products and stores, ranked by revenue and volume, to support executive dashboards."
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "source_file": "products_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "product_id",
      "target_column": "product_id",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "products_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "product_name",
      "target_column": "product_name",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "products_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "category",
      "target_column": "category",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "products_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "standard_price",
      "target_column": "standard_price",
      "data_type": "float",
      "transformation_logic": "AVG(standard_price) AS avg_standard_price"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "transaction_id",
      "target_column": "transaction_id",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "transaction_date",
      "target_column": "transaction_date",
      "data_type": "datetime",
      "transformation_logic": "keep"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "store_id",
      "target_column": "store_id",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "product_id",
      "target_column": "product_id",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "product_name",
      "target_column": "product_name",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "category",
      "target_column": "category",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "quantity",
      "target_column": "quantity",
      "data_type": "integer",
      "transformation_logic": "SUM(quantity * unit_price) AS total_cost"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "unit_price",
      "target_column": "unit_price",
      "data_type": "float",
      "transformation_logic": "AVG(unit_price) AS avg_unit_price"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "total_amount",
      "target_column": "total_amount",
      "data_type": "float",
      "transformation_logic": "SUM(total_amount) - SUM(quantity * unit_price) AS gross_margin"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "customer_segment",
      "target_column": "customer_segment",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "keep"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "sales_data_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "payment_method",
      "target_column": "payment_method",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "keep"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "stores_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "store_id",
      "target_column": "store_id",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "stores_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "store_name",
      "target_column": "store_name",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "stores_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "region",
      "target_column": "region",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "GROUP_BY"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "stores_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "city",
      "target_column": "city",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "keep"
    },
    {
      "source_file": "stores_silver.parquet",
      "source_column": "state",
      "target_column": "state",
      "data_type": "string",
      "transformation_logic": "keep"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Use left joins from sales_data_silver to products_silver on product_id and to stores_silver on store_id to preserve all sales records while enriching with product and store attributes.",
    "Revenue aggregation should be performed on the fact_sales table after joins, using SUM(total_amount) and SUM(quantity * unit_price) to capture both sales value and volume.",
    "KPI columns that involve calculations (e.g., gross margin, average unit price) must be stored as derived columns in the gold layer to avoid recomputation in downstream BI tools.",
    "Include a surrogate key for each dimension to enable efficient joins and maintain referential integrity in the star schema.",
    "Partition the gold tables by year and month to optimize query performance for time\u2011series analyses."
  ]
}